  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Study visit (training &amp; visit to NL) of the Qatari Ministry of Labour</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The purpose of this project is to support the capacity building of 13 key policy makers/team-leads from the Qatari Ministry of Labour in the field of dispute resolution and the broader landscape of social dialogue. The aim is to contribute to the improvement of labour conditions for workers &#x2013; majority labour migrants &#x2013; in Qatar. This project is therefore foreseen to contribute to a trilateral Memorandum of Understanding (MoU) between the Government of the State of Qatar, the Kingdom of the Netherlands and the International Labour Organization (2023-2025).</narrative>
  </description>
